``dials.tof_integrate``: add ``overlaps.mode``. ``mask`` keeps reflections whose bounding boxes overlap, masking the voxels they share, instead of rejecting them all; ``deconvolve`` also fits clusters of overlapped reflections jointly in 3D against the profile library, optionally with an intensity prior from merged reference data (``overlaps.reference``). ``overlaps.estimator=joint`` fits every reflection with the same 3D model, so that all profile-fitted intensities come from one estimator.
